    each non-bar row takes nearest bar's color; marker column gets src_marker
    each bar row becomes all src_marker with marker column = bg_marker
    midpoint row between different-color bars (even gap) becomes all src_marker (separator)
    midpoint between same-color bars stays as that bar's color (no separator)

generation_strategy:
  approach: direct (input structure is simple enough)
