    4. Assign colors to bars so same-color bars are consecutive in sequence
    5. Place bars at rows such that no bar at row 0 or 15, gaps >= 1
    6. Fill grid -- bg rows get bg with bg_marker in marker column; bar rows get bar_color with src_marker in marker column
